{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43175","headline":"芳树 · 李叔卿","name":"芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春看玫瑰树，西邻即宋家。\n门深重暗叶，墙近度飞花。\n影拂桃阴浅，香传李迳斜。\n靓妆愁日暮，流涕向窗纱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李叔卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}